Package: local-parental-control
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Maintainer: Local Parental Control maintainers
Depends: systemd
Description: Local application time limits for Linux users
 A local-only root daemon that measures application usage for configured
 users and terminates applications after their daily allowance is exhausted.
 Administration is performed through the lpctl command-line tool.

